msgid ""
"Use the <i>share</i> security level if you have a home network or a small "
"office network.<br /> It allows everyone to read the list of all your shared "
"directories and printers before a login is required."
msgstr ""
"यदि तपाईँसँग गृह सञ्जाल वा सानो कार्यालय सञ्जाल छ भने <i>साझेदार</i> सुरक्षा स्तर प्रयोग "
"गर्नुहोस् ।<br> यसले लगइन आवश्यक हुनु पहिले साझेदार गरिएको तपाईँको सबै डाइरेक्टरी र "
"मुद्रकको सूची पढ्न हरेकलाई अनुमति दिन्छ ।"

#: advanced/kcm_sambaconf/kcminterface.cpp:82
#: advanced/kcm_sambaconf/kcminterface.ui.h:71
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Use the <i>user</i> security level if you have a bigger network and you "
#| "do not want to allow everyone to read your list of shared directories and "
#| "printers without a login.<p>If you want to run your Samba server as a "
#| "<b>Primary Domain controller</b> (PDC) you also have to set this option."
msgid ""
"Use the <i>user</i> security level if you have a bigger network and you do "
"not want to allow everyone to read your list of shared directories and "
"printers without a login.<br /><br />If you want to run your Samba server as "
"a <b>Primary Domain controller</b> (PDC) you also have to set this option."
msgstr ""
"यदि तपाईँसँग ठूलो सञ्जाल छ र तपाईँ लगइन बिना साझेदार गरिएको डाइरेक्टरी वा मुद्रकको "
"तपाईँको सूची पढ्न दिन चाहनुहुन्न भने <i>प्रयोगकर्ता</i> सुरक्षा स्तर प्रयोग गर्नुहोस् "
"।<p>यदि तपाईँ तपाईँको साम्बा सर्भर <b>प्राथमिक डोमेन नियन्त्रकको रूपमा चलाउन चाहनुहुन्छ "
"भने</b> (PDC) तपाईँले पनि यो विकल्प सेट गर्नुपर्नेछ ।"

#: advanced/kcm_sambaconf/kcminterface.cpp:91
#: advanced/kcm_sambaconf/kcminterface.ui.h:80
msgid ""
"Use the <i>server</i> security level if you have a big network and the samba "
"server should validate the username/password by passing it to another SMB "
"server, such as an NT box."
msgstr ""
"यदि तपाईँसँग ठूलो सञ्जाल छ भने <i>सर्भर</i> सुरक्षा तह प्रयोग गर्नुहोस् र साम्बासर्भरले "
"यसलाई अर्को SMB सर्भरमा पास गरेर प्रयोगकर्तानाम/पासवर्ड वैध गर्नेछ, जस्तै एउटा NT बाकस ।"

#: advanced/kcm_sambaconf/kcminterface.cpp:99
#: advanced/kcm_sambaconf/kcminterface.ui.h:88
msgid ""
"Use the <i>domain</i> security level if you have a big network and the samba "
"server should validate the username/password by passing it to a Windows NT "
"Primary or Backup Domain Controller."
msgstr ""
"यदि तपाईँसँग ठूलो सञ्जाल छ भने <i>डोमेन</i> सुरक्षा तह प्रयोग गर्नुहोस् र साम्बा सर्भरले "
"यसलाई विन्डोज NT प्राइमेरी वा जगेडा डोमेन नियन्त्रकमा पास गरेर प्रयोगकर्तानाम/पासवर्ड "
"वैध गर्नेछ ।"

#: advanced/kcm_sambaconf/kcminterface.cpp:107
#: advanced/kcm_sambaconf/kcminterface.ui.h:96
msgid ""
"Use the <i>ADS</i> security level if you have a big network and the samba "
"server should act as a domain member in an ADS realm."
msgstr ""
"यदि तपाईँसँग ठूलो सञ्जाल छ भने <i>ADS</i> सुरक्षा तह प्रयोग गर्नुहोस् र साम्बा सर्भरले "
"एउटा प्रभुतामा डोमेन सदस्यको रूपमा कार्य गर्नेछ ।"

